    </decisions>
    <description>Quick Action screen flow for the Sales Receptionist / Meet &amp; Greet User to create a Lead for a walk-in showroom customer (BRD 8.1 ALF-LM-01 FR1, LFRDN-605). Hardcodes Lead Channel = &quot;Walk-in&quot; and defaults City/Country, so those never rely on the standard New Lead form (which withholds Walk-in from every other persona per LFRDN-602 #4). Gated by AF_CanSetWalkInLeadChannel, the same custom permission the Walk-in-channel validation rule checks, so only Receptionist personas can launch this.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>AF_Formula_IsDuplicateFault</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>CONTAINS({!$Flow.FaultMessage}, &quot;DUPLICATES_DETECTED&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
